{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08976","headline":"晦日处士叔园林燕集 · 韦应物","name":"晦日处士叔园林燕集","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"遽看蓂叶尽，坐阙芳年赏。\n赖此林下期，清风涤烦想。\n始萌动新煦，佳禽发幽响。\n岚岭对高斋，春流灌蔬壤。\n罇酒遗形迹，道言屡开奖。\n幸蒙终夕懽，聊用税归鞅。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_08976.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08976","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}